    "detailed_description": "You are the virus STUXnet, endowed with a special ability to compress axes. To carry out a hacker\u2019s successful revenge, you must navigate through the computer system and take control of it according to the hacker\u2019s commands. Good luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique 3-Way Axis Compression Logic</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.poster.avif?t=1723715051\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.webm?t=1723715051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.mp4?t=1723715051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Axis compression is an ability that allows the player to change the stage from a 3D environment to a 2D environment. Players can clear stages by utilizing this core ability. The stages in STUXnet are based on this core gimmick of axis compression and are composed of additional gimmicks that build upon it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Adventure Inside the Computer</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/4422575595cc660fed2be0f1213344fd.avif?t=1723715051\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>STUXnet takes place in the unseen world inside a computer. The game features six chapters, each inspired by different computer components such as the motherboard, cooler, power supply, storage, GPU, and CPU. Each chapter contains unique gimmicks reminiscent of these components.",
    "about_the_game": "You are the virus STUXnet, endowed with a special ability to compress axes. To carry out a hacker\u2019s successful revenge, you must navigate through the computer system and take control of it according to the hacker\u2019s commands. Good luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique 3-Way Axis Compression Logic</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.poster.avif?t=1723715051\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.webm?t=1723715051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/7e36a03216614c4af30866b5bffa3fce.mp4?t=1723715051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Axis compression is an ability that allows the player to change the stage from a 3D environment to a 2D environment. Players can clear stages by utilizing this core ability. The stages in STUXnet are based on this core gimmick of axis compression and are composed of additional gimmicks that build upon it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Adventure Inside the Computer</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138270/extras/4422575595cc660fed2be0f1213344fd.avif?t=1723715051\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>STUXnet takes place in the unseen world inside a computer. The game features six chapters, each inspired by different computer components such as the motherboard, cooler, power supply, storage, GPU, and CPU. Each chapter contains unique gimmicks reminiscent of these components.",
